message: "If you use this atlas, its networks or its code, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Mechanistic Interpretability Circuit Atlas"
abstract: >-
  For algorithmic tasks, an exact hand-built transformer is compared with networks trained over many seeds on frozen hand-built
  parts and from scratch: which circuit each seed converges to, how often, and whether a closed form of it keeps accuracy when
  substituted back into the network.
